{"id":"bec60cf74d373d75","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-levy-ito-mod.md","title":"Càdlàg Modification of a Lévy Process","display":"thm-levy-ito-mod — Càdlàg Modification of a Lévy Process","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-ito-mod","aliases":["58-thm-levy-ito-mod"],"display":"thm-levy-ito-mod — Càdlàg Modification of a Lévy Process","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-ito-mod"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-ito-mod</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-ito-mod — Càdlàg Modification of a Lévy Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84ce8c835a688c6a\" href=\"?note=84ce8c835a688c6a\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md\">../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\widetilde X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,t,\\omega,x_\\omega\\in V\">\\(X,\\widetilde X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,t,\\omega,x_\\omega\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (typed process and path predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (modification predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}process\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\})=1\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}process\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\})=1\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}ito\\text{-}modification}\\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists\\widetilde X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists x_\\omega\\;[\\mathrm{Function}(x_\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(x_\\omega(t)=\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega))\\land\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(x_\\omega)]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}ito\\text{-}modification}\\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists\\widetilde X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists x_\\omega\\;[\\mathrm{Function}(x_\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(x_\\omega(t)=\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega))\\land\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(x_\\omega)]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sigma-algebra is an explicit modification parameter, and every sample path is witnessed as a genuine function before the càdlàg predicate is applied.</li>\n<li>This is the regular-modification theorem, not the separate Lévy–Itô decomposition into drift, Gaussian, and jump parts.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md","status":"resolved","id":"84ce8c835a688c6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-cadlag.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\widetilde X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,t,\\omega,x_\\omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}process\\text{-}modification}\\vdash\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\Bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega\\mid\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega)=X(t)(\\omega)\\})=1\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}ito\\text{-}modification}\\vdash \\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\to\\exists\\widetilde X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Modification}_S(\\widetilde X,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists x_\\omega\\;[\\mathrm{Function}(x_\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(x_\\omega(t)=\\widetilde X(t)(\\omega))\\land\\mathrm{Cadlag}_{\\mathbb R}(x_\\omega)]\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-levy-ito-mod.md|58-thm-levy-ito-mod]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d0a20d5f74408674","84ce8c835a688c6a","36d7463d215be751"]}